    "Reg_SL1_B": "I understand that!",
    "Reg_SL1_H": "Hey! 😊",
    "Reg_SL1_T": "From now on, your chats will be saved, so you can access them later at any time, across devices. Your entries are completely secure: everything you write is encrypted. This means that no one, not even the university, can see what you have written. 🕵️ Your entries are stored at OpenAI for 30 days and then deleted. GWDG does not store any data. In both cases, your data remains unused for product improvement or behavioral analysis.",
    "Reg_SL2_B": "I like it!",
    "Reg_SL2_H": "New: Group Chats! 💡",
    "Reg_SL2_T": "In the new group chats, naturally, all group members can see your messages - that's the whole point. But even here, your content remains protected and is not visible to anyone outside the group. Your privacy is important to us, so you can rest assured: your data belongs to you alone! 🙌",
    "Reg_SL4_B": "Will do!",
    "Reg_SL4_H": "Create your Datakey! 🔒",
    "Reg_SL4_T": "<strong>Important:</strong> On your first login, you create your personal data key, a type of password. Your chats are encrypted with this data key before being stored on our server. In addition to the login, you will need your data key when you log in on a new device. Your device or browser remembers your data key, so you don't have to enter it every time. In the final step, you can also download the recovery code for your data key.",
    "Reg_SL5_H": "Create your Datakey! 🔒",
    "Reg_SL5_T": "<strong>Please note:</strong> Your chat messages are securely encrypted. If you lose your data key, you will no longer be able to access your previous chats. Therefore, keep your data key safe and protect it from third-party access.",
    "Reg_SL6_H": "Secure your Recovery Code! 🔒",
    "Reg_SL6_T": "With this recovery code, you can restore your data key if you forget or lose it. Download your code onto your device and store it in a secure location, such as on a USB stick or in a protected environment.",
